sequenceDiagram
    participant Caller
    participant Target as Instrumented function<br/>(net/http serverHandler.ServeHTTP)
    participant Tramp as Trampolines<br/>OtelBefore/AfterTrampoline_ServeHTTP
    participant Hook as Hook functions<br/>BeforeServeHTTP / AfterServeHTTP
    participant Body as Original body

    Caller->>Target: ServeHTTP(rw, req)
    Target->>Tramp: OtelBeforeTrampoline_ServeHTTP(&sh, &rw, &req)
    Tramp->>Hook: BeforeServeHTTP(hookContext, ...) via //go:linkname
    Hook-->>Tramp: may change parameters through hookContext
    Tramp-->>Target: hookContext (panics in the hook are recovered here)
    Note over Target: defer OtelAfterTrampoline_ServeHTTP(hookContext)
    Target->>Body: original statements run
    Body-->>Target: return
    Target->>Tramp: deferred OtelAfterTrampoline_ServeHTTP(hookContext)
    Tramp->>Hook: AfterServeHTTP(hookContext) via //go:linkname
    Hook-->>Tramp: may change return values
    Target-->>Caller: return
